  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Twin Palms Cottage in Blue Mountain Beach<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Welcome to Twin Palms Cottage. Nestled amid pines, magnolia, and palm trees, this classic Florida cottage sits on a quiet street that is only three blocks off of 30 A - the perfect launchpad for your vacation adventures. Live music and dining are within walking distance. Two public beach access points are a three-minute drive or an eight-minute bike ride away. Or you can take a pleasant short stroll along tree-lined streets and a walking trail that traverses a covered bridge with views of Draper Lake. A welcoming abode with ample indoor and outdoor living and dining space, there will be plenty of room for your crew to both relax and entertain. When you want to hit the waves, Blue Mountain Beach is less than two miles from home. <br><br><br><br>Sip morning coffee on the 36-foot-long screened-in front porch equipped with a chaise lounge, rocking chairs, and a hanging bed. Have coffee or play cards while watching the birds in the front yard trees or dine alfresco on the secluded back deck and paved patio. Inside, find wood floors, plush furnishings, and all the comforts of home. Kick back on the light blue sofas for movie nights on the TV. A full kitchen is equipped with a suite of appliances, a coffee bar, and a four-person table. Added perks include complimentary WiFi and TVs with streaming capabilities. If you like quick access to all the adventures of 30 A with a quiet retreat to retire to, then make this your home away from home.<br><br><br><br><b>THINGS TO KNOW</b><br><br>Streaming available with own account logins",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Garden cottage close to beach with screened porch, WiFi, and central AC"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
